	"notice": "Select APC mini mk2 as a control surface in Ableton Live and enable the documented performance input (Port 2) for note playback. Clip Launch, Drum and Note modes use different layouts; fader functions depend on the active mode. These clip buttons are not presented as velocity-sensitive drum pads. No fixed note or CC map is assumed. This is MK2, not the original APC mini. Select the profile manually if the host does not identify it: no unverified port aliases are supplied. Diagrams are original simplified schematics, not scale drawings. Physical controls without a binding are informational; use MIDI learn for configurable assignments.",
